    bio: "Janiah Lambert, PA-C, is a nationally board-certified physician assistant at First Medical Associates in Severna Park, MD. She graduated and received her Master of Science in Physician Assistant Studies from Ithaca College in 2024. She attended and graduated from Clark University with a degree in Psychology and a minor in Biology in 2021. While attending Clark University, she worked as an EMT and nursing assistant and gained experience as a patient care technician in an emergency department. She played soccer for a total of 15 years and played for 2 years at Clark University. Janiah is deeply committed to delivering personalized care and collaborating with patients to help them achieve their health goals. She is also dedicated to ensuring that every patient feels valued, heard, and respected throughout their care journey. Janiah’s special medical interests include mental health and women’s health. In her free time, Janiah enjoys eating plant-based food, exercising, watching movies, and spending time with friends and family.",
